OL,3,GNEWSAFundraiser for A66 crash police
OL,4,Aofficers tops #1m
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmong the donations to the police
OL,7,Fofficers' fundraiser, which was
OL,8,Flaunched by the Cleveland Police
OL,9,FFederation, was #4,000 from the
OL,10,FCleveland branch of the National
OL,11,FAssociation of Retired Police Officers.
OL,13,FIts chair Grant Thorburn said the
OL,14,Fofficers' deaths had "hit home hard"
OL,15,Fand that seeing the tributes and
OL,16,Fdonations paid to them had been
OL,17,F"humbling".
